{"id":851400,"title":"01｜DeepSeek是怎样发展起来的？","content":"DeepSeek R1自2023年5月成立，至2024年12月发布V3版本，再于2025年1月推出R1，历时一年半。其成功源于踩在OpenAI等先驱者的肩膀上，通过开源策略和MoE模型创新，实现了与GPT-4o相近的性能。DeepSeek V3拥有671B参数，激活比例为337B，在多项评测中表现出色，尤其在生成速度上提升了三倍。R1则基于V3基座模型，通过强化学习技术进一步优化，效果显著。DeepSeek的开源政策允许用户蒸馏R1模型，促进了社区发展。然而，蒸馏版本并不等同于原版R1，实际体验可能受限于基础模型能力。尽管如此，DeepSeek R1为开源社区提供了高质量的推理模型，推动了大模型的发展。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397795,"user_name":"Geek_满天繁星","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3831248,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"2B61E803E62B16","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739591632,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100968801,"comment_content":"幻方量化与Deepseek什么关系？股东？为什么说因此deepseek没有孤注一掷的压力？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1183184,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/0d/d0/b48302e9.jpg","nickname":"HuDP","note":"","ucode":"65E70A9B7CAB54","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668476,"discussion_content":"腾讯和王者荣耀的关系吧","content_length":11,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1752478910,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"中国香港","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398125,"user_name":"仗剑天涯","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1179327,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"5EB9BD1132592C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/fe/bf/58a8aa1f.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1740549878,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100968801,"comment_content":"国货之光","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":397755,"user_name":"木子","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1027721,"